      "cooked": "<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Akash’thriya: Not fully recovered form.</li>\n<li>Akash’buta: Recovered enough to fight the Argent Adept in giant form.</li>\n<li>Akash’(something): Fully recovered form?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The words thriya and buta are related to the numbers 3 and 2. Do you think there will be a form that would be related to the number 1 and be even stronger than Akash’buta?</p>",
