      "created_at": "2016-03-06T17:39:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jan111\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/ad7895/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jan111:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Didn't knew there was allready a other form. Will check it out.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nope.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's in Playtesting.&nbsp; We hear about it a lot, but that's it for those of us not in the secret clubhouse.</p>",
