      "created_at": "2016-03-06T18:07:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know Ironic knows about this, but the OP probably doesn't: the best public information is from this full-day event:&nbsp;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RXwfuSixyo&amp;list=PLBZBled0v3sJ82jQwoL3lqrISQBltyQ-O</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Honestly, the playtesters get very little story information. Some of the Wrath of the Cosmos decks were pretty mysterious until we got the final proofs.</p>",
