      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I know Ironic knows about this, but the OP probably doesn&#39;t: the best public information is from this full-day event:&nbsp;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RXwfuSixyo&amp;list=PLBZBled0v3sJ82jQwoL3lqrISQBltyQ-O</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Honestly, the playtesters get very little story information. Some of the Wrath of the Cosmos decks were pretty mysterious until we got the final proofs.</p>",
