      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-06T23:22:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's fair.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My frustration on things like the Akash stuff isn't so much the belief that all the Playtesters are in on some big secret, it's that it seems to me that sometimes, you guys forget you're in the portion of the forums where a lot of people aren't testers at all, so you make these seemingly all-inclusive statements which don't apply to the full conversation - such as this thread, where two people mentioned the Tactics Akash without specifying that it was currently just in testing.</p><p>The link is much more helpful - thanks for posting it!</p>",
