      "cooked": "<p>How is giving a name that was in an art livestream from months ago an all inclusive statement? &nbsp; I replied to mwc146 who was trying to list the name and couldn't fully recall it. &nbsp;Being a playtester or not ( I only became one during the recent chance given in January) I still likely would have given the same response. &nbsp;If questioned on how I knew the name I would have further looked up the YouTube video that dpt did and linked that. &nbsp; Sure there are secrets but what is there is straight gameplay to be tested until proofs are given from what I've looked at.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
