      "created_at": "2016-03-07T02:03:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I meant to indicate that Akash'Dharsha wasn't yet available by putting in \"(upcoming)\". It did take me a few minutes to track down the link, I wouldn't have done that unless it was obviously useful. But it also seems that the wiki is out of date:&nbsp;http://sotm.wikidot.com/villain:akash-bhuta mentions neither Akash'Thriya nor Akash'Dharsha. I don't have time right this instant to fix it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I agree there's a tendency to become cliquish and not explain terms. That's why we encourage people to spell out card names, for instance.</p>",
